graph LR
    RayModOp["ray-module-operator"]

    %% Go Library Dependencies
    RayModOp -->|operator framework| ControllerRuntime["controller-runtime v0.23.3"]
    RayModOp -->|reconciliation pipeline,<br/>platform detection,<br/>manifest rendering| ODHPlatformUtils["odh-platform-utilities<br/>(Go library)"]
    RayModOp -->|K8s API types| K8sAPI_lib["k8s.io/api v0.35.3"]
    RayModOp -->|version parsing| Semver["semver/v3 v3.5.0"]

    %% Internal Platform Dependencies
    RayModOp -->|CRD dependency check| CertManager["cert-manager"]
    RayModOp -->|platform config| PlatformOp["Platform Operator<br/>(odh-ray-config ConfigMap)"]

    %% Managed Operand
    RayModOp -->|deploys + manages| KubeRay["kuberay-operator<br/>(operand)"]

    %% KubeRay Dependencies
    KubeRay -->|ingress mgmt| GatewayAPI["Gateway API<br/>(HTTPRoutes, Gateways)"]
    KubeRay -->|dashboard access| OSRoutes["OpenShift Routes"]
    KubeRay -->|pod security| SCC["OpenShift SCC<br/>(filtered on non-OCP)"]

    %% Integration Points
    Prometheus["Prometheus"] -->|metrics scrape<br/>8080/TCP| KubeRay
    Workbenches["Workbenches<br/>(Notebooks)"] -.->|binds ray ClusterRole| RayModOp

    %% External Services
    RayModOp -->|reconciliation, SSA| K8sAPIServer["Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP"]
    KubeRay -->|workload mgmt| K8sAPIServer

